Top Alternatives by Use Case
- For Static & JAMstack Sites:
Cloudflare Pages offers fast global distribution, integrated edge functions, and a generous free tier with great pricing.
- For Full-Stack Apps & APIs: Render balances simplicity and backend flexibility, supporting web services, cron jobs, and PostgreSQL databases.
Railway offers smooth Git-based deployments with predictable usage-based pricing.
- For Self-Hosted Control: Coolify gives you a Vercel-like dashboard that you can install on your own virtual private server (VPS) to avoid unexpected cloud platform bills. 

